              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Linda T"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I used frozen haricort vert instead of fresh it it was very tasty. The only part that didn't work for me was the tomato. It kind of got lost. I think the dish needed a bit of a different texture so next time I'll drop the tomato and add some toasted sliced almonds"
          },
